        "description": "Calculates the natural logarithm (base e) of cells in a raster.",
        "in_raster_or_constant.descr": "<xdoc><p>Input values for which to find the natural logarithm (Ln).</p><p>To use a number as an input for this parameter, the cell size and extent must first be set in the environment.</p></xdoc>",
